        {
          "title": "1. Clearing Content",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>All map items you've created in ATAK or received as data packages are stored in your device.</li>\n<li>Clear content in ENDEX to maintain sanity and avoid accumulating data (opsec).</li>\n<li>To do so, tap the <strong>Trashcan icon</strong> in the main menu.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/802490de29695a84.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "2. Are You Sure?",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tap the two selectors to enable clearing.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f4b2b0bfecd49805.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "3. Complete!",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Clear Content empties everything and closes the app. Done!</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        }
